        "content": "## UXR test runner\nManual only. Search and Start call original subworkflows. Handler Regression reads current staging Handler code and tests it with synthetic contexts; does not execute the full handler or deliver Slack messages.\n\nTest calls include test_mode: true. Search reads Customer.io. Start covers invalid context only. No Send workflow is called. Handler regression only uses a GET to the staging workflow API.\n\nManual Slack UI verification remains separate.",
